---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
const repo = 'https://github.com/zuohuadong/volt-gui';
---
<Base title="VoltUI documentation" titleEn="VoltUI documentation" titleZh="VoltUI 文档" description="Install, run and verify the VoltUI Electron shell around the official DeepSeek Harness runtime.">
  <SiteHeader active="docs" />
  <main class="wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">DOCUMENTATION / 文档</div><h1>Electron + official DeepSeek Harness.</h1><p>The supported product is the Electron shell and the official DSH package. Legacy runtime and upstream synchronization lines are retired.</p></section><section class="home-section"><h2 id="install">Install / 安装</h2><pre class="codeblock"><button data-copy="corepack enable && corepack prepare pnpm@11.23.0 --activate && pnpm install --frozen-lockfile">Copy</button>corepack enable
corepack prepare pnpm@11.23.0 --activate
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</pre><p>Use Node <code>26.8.1</code> or a compatible Node 26 patch release. The lockfile pins the official DSH package and all transitive DSH bundles.</p><h2 id="run">Run / 运行</h2><pre class="codeblock"><button data-copy="pnpm run desktop">Copy</button>pnpm run desktop</pre><p>The Electron shell starts <code>@deepseek-ai/dsh web</code> as a managed child, applies <code>profiles/anyong.yml</code>, and loads only its trusted loopback URL.</p><h2 id="verify">Verify / 验证</h2><pre class="codeblock"><button data-copy="pnpm test && pnpm run test:dsh-integration && pnpm run build">Copy</button>pnpm test
pnpm run test:dsh-integration
pnpm run build</pre><p>For Windows packaging run <code>pnpm run dist:desktop</code>. The current release workflow produces an unsigned-review artifact and records SHA-256 hashes; signing and notarization are intentionally fail-closed.</p><h2 id="configuration">Configuration / 配置</h2><p>Set <code>DSH_WORKSPACE</code> for the initial workspace and <code>DSH_HOME</code> for runtime storage. Provider credentials and session data are handled by the official DSH profile. Do not put secrets in the repository or renderer.</p><h2 id="source">Source map / 源码边界</h2><ul><li><a href={`${repo}/tree/main/apps/desktop-electron`}>Electron shell</a>: window security and child lifecycle.</li><li><a href={`${repo}/tree/main/profiles`}>Profile patch</a>: product defaults over official DSH bundles.</li><li><a href={`${repo}/tree/main/scripts`}>Verification scripts</a>: runtime, migration and packaging contracts.</li><li><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/AGENTS.md`}>Repository instructions</a>: contribution and verification policy.</li></ul></section></main><SiteFooter />
</Base>
